# matchers.json contains auto-discovered entries generated from ~/.claude/skills/ at
# install time. Only the hand-written seed entries are tracked (no auto-discovered).
# After cloning, run `bun run install` to regenerate auto-discovered entries locally.
# IMPORTANT: Do not commit matchers.json after running bun run install — the auto-
# discovered entries reflect your private local skill installation.
# skill-router/matchers.json   ← uncomment this line if you want full gitignore
